              "description": [
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "As a tech lead my main responsibility is to develop and implement the long term vision for observability at Yelp. My main focus has been on rewriting out main metrics pipeline in golang to help with scalability and availability issues, standardizing RED service metrics and access and error logs across all Yelp services and across all languages and revamping our SLO and alerting frameworks to make it easier for developers to configure and debug performance and error degradations.\n\nIn addition part of my time is spent helping the other developers in the team grow skill-wise and career-wise and helping the manager to make sure the team runs smoothly."
                }
              ]
            },
