              "title": "Software Engineer",
              "caption": "Oct 2018 - Jan 2020 · 1 yr 3 mos",
              "description": [
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "SRE (observability team):\n• Designed and lead the team implementing the Zipkin \"firehose\", a highly efficient custom pipeline based on the opensource Zipkin project to trace 100% of requests while minimizing costs."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Software Engineer",
              "caption": "Nov 2015 - Oct 2018 · 2 yrs 11 mos",
              "metadata": "San Francisco Bay Area",
              "description": [
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "Performance team:\n• Lead a project for migrating our main monolith from the apache httpd server to uWSGI. This migration allowed us to do most of the memory allocations before forking and exploit linux copy-on-write mechanism to reduce the total memory usage by more than 60%.\n• Developed a transparent HTTP caching proxy https://github.com/Yelp/casper based on nginx and openresty."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Software Engineer",
              "caption": "Apr 2015 - Nov 2015 · 7 mos",
              "metadata": "San Francisco Bay Area",
              "description": [
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "Developed a new metrics pipeline based on a custom extension of the statsd protocol: we implemented a mechanism to send multi-dimensional metrics aggregated via statsite to our real-time monitoring system. 6 years later, this is still the preferred and easiest way for developers to emit their metrics."
                }
              ]
